<div class="container mt-5">
  <section id="about" class="mb-5">
    <h2 class="section-title">About</h2>
    <div class="intro-card mb-5">
      <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start flex-wrap gap-3">
        <div>
          <span class="availability-badge mb-2 d-inline-block">
            <span class="availability-dot"></span> Open to work
          </span>
          <h1 class="intro-tagline">Full stack developer specialising in Ruby on Rails</h1>
          <p class="intro-bio">
            Based in Northampton, I build robust web applications across the full stack — 
            from database design and API integration to responsive front-end interfaces. 
            Currently open to junior and mid-level opportunities.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-between" style="min-height: 130px;">
          <a href="/joe-knight-cv.pdf" download="Joe-Knight-CV.pdf" class="btn btn-primary d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
            <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-arrow-down"></i> Download CV
          </a>
          <div class="contact-details">
            <a href="tel:+447928342810" class="contact-item">
              <i class="bi bi-telephone"></i> +44 7928 342810
            </a>
            <a href="mailto:joeknight2004@protonmail.com" class="contact-item">
              <i class="bi bi-envelope"></i> joeknight2004@protonmail.com
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p>
      I'm Joe Knight, a junior developer based in Northampton with commercial experience building 
      Ruby on Rails applications across carbon reporting, e-commerce, and internal tooling. 
      I enjoy working across the full stack from database design and API integration through 
      to responsive front-end interfaces.
    </p>

    <p>
      Outside of professional work I enjoy taking on personal infrastructure challenges. 
      This site runs on a self-hosted <span class="fw-bold">Synology NAS</span> using 
      <span class="fw-bold">Rails 8</span>, <span class="fw-bold">Docker</span>, 
      <span class="fw-bold">PostgreSQL</span>, and a <span class="fw-bold">Cloudflare Tunnel</span> 
      for secure public access built from scratch as a learning exercise in self-hosting and DevOps. 
      The source code is available on <%= link_to "GitHub", "https://github.com/joe-lad/Portfolio", target: "_blank" %>.
    </p>

    <p>
      You can also view my <%= link_to "legacy portfolio", "https://old.jknight.uk", target: "_blank" %>, 
      an earlier project that demonstrates my progression as a developer.
    </p>
  </section>
  
